<section id="fitness-overview">
  <h2>1. Project Overview</h2>
  <p><strong>Fitness Center Membership, Revenue &amp; Retention Analytics</strong> is a multi-page Power BI project created for the Onyx Data Challenge. The report represents MyGym Fitness Center and explores membership revenue, subscription attributes, churn indicators, member engagement, demographics and gym-location performance. It is challenge work, not a commercial deployment for an actual fitness business.</p>
  <p>The available project evidence is the PBIX report and an Executive Summary screenshot. The supplied project description also names Power Query, Python, Jupyter Notebook and DAX; however, no notebook is present in the inspected project files, and the PBIX layout does not expose complete formulas or the full query script. The page distinguishes those documented tools from technical steps that could not be verified.</p>
  <div class="fitness-kpi-grid" aria-label="Executive Summary dashboard KPIs">
    <div class="fitness-kpi"><strong>$68.9K</strong><span>Total Revenue</span></div>
    <div class="fitness-kpi"><strong>$34.5</strong><span>Average Final Price</span></div>
